{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version only includes 3 bosses. To experience the full game, please add it to your wishlist and wait for the official release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/6.png?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So make good use of this power, and in the endless cycles of reincarnation, defeat each princess to find a way to regain freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/\u591a\u4eba.gif?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/4.png?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simple and relaxing idle game. Under your guidance, everything will happen naturally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have prepared numerous CG endings, waiting for you to discover as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/\u56fe\u5c42_5444.png?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/5.png?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/\u8ffd.gif?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How can you defeat the powerful princesses?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain stronger equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn a variety of skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reincarnate in infinite rebirths to gain even greater power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/\u56fe\u5c42_344445555.png?t=1749451734\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755870?t=1749451734","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3755870?t=1749451734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/12c08bc66eba1d648abdee32eebcdd0a11a4d8db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749451734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/12c08bc66eba1d648abdee32eebcdd0a11a4d8db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749451734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version only includes 3 bosses. To experience the full game, please add it to your wishlist and wait for the official release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755870/extras/6.png?t=1749451734\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We want freedom, not slavery,&quot; the goblin muttered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the goblin's declaration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once just an experience fodder at the bottom of another world, now he is determined to challenge the princesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Though it won't be easy, with the blessing of the Nature Goddess, he has been granted the &quot;Power of Rebirth.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So m